# Cline rules — Ocran Strategic Consulting
- Before every task, read AGENTS.md in full, then the SKILL.md listed for the task type in AGENTS.md §8.
- Always present a short plan + file list and wait for approval before editing more than one file.
- Never read, print or modify .env* files — except .env.example, which holds variable names only (no values) and must be kept current. Never run deploy, DNS, or git push commands.
- Finish every task by running: pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm build — and report results.
- Never invent client copy, numbers, testimonials or case studies. Use {{TODO: copy needed — ...}}.
